{"id":"wb-7-1096","name":"仙游文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"仙游文庙","text":"仙游文庙，位于中国福建省莆田市仙游县鲤城街道城内社区师范路1号，是一座文庙建筑。该文庙始建于唐朝，北宋时期迁于现址，此后历朝历代均有重修，现存建筑多为明清时期所建。该文庙占地面积约为7600平方米，主要建筑包括大成殿和明伦堂等。2013年，仙游文庙被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BB%99%E6%B8%B8%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92343480,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92343480","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/076d6d13dabe670dcd9303f5.jpg","title":"仙游文庙大成殿.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BB%99%E6%B8%B8%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%90%E6%AE%BF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/%E4%BB%99%E6%B8%B8%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%90%E6%AE%BF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acd Hauroud","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​仙游文庙大成殿","width":320,"height":240}}